OL,3,ATrump threatens to 'annihilate' Iran in
OL,4,AUN speech as officials from both
OL,5,Acountries meet on sidelines
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump has told the
OL,8,FUnited Nations General Assembly (UNGA)
OL,9,Fhe faces a "big decision" on whether to
OL,10,Fstrike Iran again or pursue a peace
OL,11,Fdeal.
OL,13,FA single member of Iran's delegation
OL,14,Fwatched on during the president's
OL,15,Fspeech on Tuesday in New York, in which
OL,16,Fhe said he could "annihilate" the
OL,17,FIslamic Republic if the conflict went
OL,18,Funresolved.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
