OL,3,ATrump threatens to 'annihilate' Iran in
OL,4,AUN speech as officials from both
OL,5,Acountries meet on sidelines
OL,6,
OL,7,FBefore a standing-room-only audience,
OL,8,FTrump also rejected "global
OL,9,Fgovernment", vowed to broker peace
OL,10,Fbetween Russia and Ukraine and ensure
OL,11,Fthe US wins the artificial intelligence
OL,12,Frace.
OL,14,FHis comments came on a day of
OL,15,Fhigh-level diplomacy, which included
OL,16,Ftalks between US and Iranian
OL,17,Frepresentatives.
